# Gate-run output: per-harness logs and the JSON/Markdown summaries, regenerated
# on every sweep. These are build artefacts, not source.
#
# Same convention as docs/orchestration/.gitignore: a directory-scoped ignore
# file with the reason written next to it, rather than a rule bolted onto the
# app-level .gitignore where it would be far from the thing it describes.
artifacts/
